1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,400
A board gives your research room
to think out loud.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,600
From your nook, choose New board,
give it a name, and create it.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:17,775
Drag files straight onto the board: first the Utah teapot,
then the Stanford bunny.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,500
Double-click an empty spot
and type a thought of your own.

5
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:32,200
Press Control-V to paste a webpage address.
Papol turns the link into a card.

6
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,500
Paste a YouTube address the same way,
and it becomes another card.

7
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:44,075
Resize and move the cards wherever they fit.

8
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:53,550
Images, links, files, and thoughts are all cards
you can arrange. Enjoy Papol.
